{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">野村：苏州天孚光通信二季度营收低于预期，净利润超预期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看这份NOM快评里最反直觉的一组数字。苏州天孚光通信（300394 CH）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.9%</span>，低于NOM预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.6%</span>，但净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.8%</span>，同样超出预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.8%</span>。营收<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">不及预期</span>，利润反而<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，拆开看，毛利率从去年同期的49.4%跳升15.3个百分点至64.7%，是利润超预期的直接原因。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告把毛利率跳升归因于产品结构变化。上半年无源器件收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">77.4%</span>，毛利率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71.9%</span>，同比提升8.33个百分点；而有源器件收入同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.6%</span>。无源器件占比提升，自然拉高了整体毛利率。简单说，公司卖得好的东西恰好是更赚钱的东西。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV85dD56ibgOG2uqiafDMtn6OuMoQaVQ9Acvm30T01eRzFibAeIT3Uaic1eaLIe0nFDicLkDicrxNuhlIVxBozwY1m5G7yEgphoB6NME/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 无源器件放量对冲有源器件下滑，上半年净利率升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">42.6%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上半年整体收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.28亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.2%</span>，净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.04亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.9%</span>。分季度看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.98亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>，但同比微降0.9%；净利润7.12亿元，环比增长45%，同比增长27%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">无源器件的强劲增长是主引擎。报告提到，需求来自800G/1.6T光引擎等有源器件，以及FAU（光纤阵列单元）等无源器件。有源器件收入下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.6%</span>，无源器件收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">77.4%</span>，两者对冲后，上半年收入仍录得<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.2%</span>的增长。净利率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36.6%</span>提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">42.6%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>进一步升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47.5%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收同比转负这个信号，它说明有源器件下滑的影响比市场预期的更明显。简单说，无源器件的高毛利撑住了利润，但收入端的增长引擎已经切换；后续更值得观察的是有源器件收入何时恢复正增长，那决定了营收增速能否重新回到上升通道。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWeULZwx4udjrNkXCQxibkibBA5Cuofx9Xlk6JnwJC8g7K28SgO8mITm8zTtgTLK1icbfrlS9ia5gDF9YW5FwzzYf5qlH0ibpP8fuqo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. EML芯片供应约束仍在，产能爬坡是缓解关键</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.6%</span>，报告给出的原因是EML芯片持续供应紧张。EML是光模块中的关键激光器芯片，供应受限直接压制了有源器件的出货量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">产能端有两个边际变化。泰国生产基地的无源和有源光器件都在稳步爬坡，江西生产基地二期已投入使用。报告认为这可能有助于缓解出货增长不确定性。这里需要留意的是，产能释放到收入确认有时间差，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>数据尚未完全体现新增产能的贡献。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU6dBW2ntQ7PqGQIjzqsYfwE7JkqUniagkvjk5XMluZ7xnj4NaGiaWrnPHhje4W4iadSxwSoibQ8722FnO5BdC8j0ibvgIfUC4B0RQ4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 英伟达CPO量产带来新的需求变量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月14日，英伟达宣布Spectrum-X CPO交换机进入全面量产。天孚作为英伟达CPO供应链合作伙伴，报告认为公司将受益于CPO部署带来的高端FAU和ELS（外置激光器）模块需求增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这条线和前面的数据放在一起看，逻辑是连贯的：CPO交换机需要更多无源器件，而天孚的无源器件恰恰是高毛利、高增长的业务。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>无源器件收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">77.4%</span>，毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">71.9%</span>，如果CPO放量如期推进，这条产品线的增长持续性会比有源器件更确定。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 我更关注的是CPO量产对FAU和ELS模块的需求弹性。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 106-NOM-Suzhou TFC Optical Communication-300394-2Q26- revenue miss while earnings beat on higher GPM-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
